  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam and Grandpa are on the bus. A woman stands. \"Please sit here,\" says Sam. \"Thank you!\" says the woman. She smiles. Sam is happy.",
      "Then they are at the bookshop. \"Hello!\" says Grandpa. Sam has a drink. \"No eat, no drink,\" says the man. Oh no! \"Sorry!\" says Sam. Sam puts it in his bag.",
      "Then he looks at a book. It is good. \"Thank you! Goodbye!\" says Grandpa. Dad is in the car. \"Hello, Dad!\" says Sam. Is it a good day? Yes!"
    ],
    "summary": "Sam and Grandpa take the bus to a bookshop. Sam says please, thank you, sorry, hello, and goodbye.",
